      "title": {
        "en": "Galata Tower",
        "tr": null
      },
      "description": {
        "en": "From the top of this 700-year-old stone tower you can see all of İstanbul! A legend says a man named Hezarfen strapped on wooden wings and flew from here across the Bosphorus!",
