      "title": {
        "en": "The Grand Bazaar",
        "tr": null
      },
      "description": {
        "en": "One of the oldest and biggest covered markets in the world — about 4,000 shops under one roof! Colorful mosaic lamps, carpets, sweets… you could explore it for days.",
