        "en": "The Simit Cart",
        "tr": null
      },
      "description": {
        "en": "Simit is a crunchy bread ring covered in sesame seeds — İstanbul's favorite snack! Kids buy a warm simit from red street carts like this one and share pieces with the seagulls.",
